      "71": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "PIXEL GRADIENT\n\nThe Pixel Gradient node creates a texture similar to a normal map that you would encouter in a 3D texturing situation. This map can be used to modulate other nodes that use textures as modulation sources. In the example we use the UV Offset node for that purpouse."
          }
        },
